OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AI would not have voted for Zionism
OL,4,Amotion, Polanski says
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski has said he would not
OL,7,Fhave voted for a motion passed by Green
OL,8,FParty members declaring Zionism a form
OL,9,Fof racism.
OL,11,FThe Green Party leader told BBC
OL,12,FBreakfast the motion was "imperfect"
OL,13,Fand he would have voted for an amended
OL,14,Fversion.
OL,16,FHowever, he said the "substantial part
OL,17,Fof the motion", that "the displacement
OL,18,Fand genocide of the Palestinian people
OL,19,Fis clearly underpinned by a racist
OL,20,Fideology" was "obvious". Israel has
OL,21,Frepeatedly denied its actions in Gaza
OL,22,Famount to genocide.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791539288
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AI would not have voted for Zionism
OL,4,Amotion, Polanski says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motion defined Zionism as an
OL,7,Fideology supporting "an
OL,8,Fethnonationalist Jewish state" and
OL,9,Fbacked a "single democratic Palestinian
OL,10,Fstate in all of historic Palestine",
OL,11,Fwhich includes modern-day Israel.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
