OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn official review in England finds
OL,8,Fthere is a risk of people being
OL,9,Fover-diagnosed with ADHD and autism -
OL,10,Fthree key findings from the report
OL,12,FAs well as neurodevelopmental
OL,13,Fconditions, the review looks at mental
OL,14,Fill health, particularly in younger
OL,15,Fpeople. Our health correspondent
OL,16,Fexplains the difference
OL,18,FIt was commissioned earlier this year
OL,19,Fafter Wes Streeting, then the health
OL,20,Fsecretary, said there was an
OL,21,F"over-diagnosis" of mental health
OL,22,Fconditions
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791539288
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to Radio 4's Today programme
OL,8,Fearlier, review chair Prof Peter Fonagy
OL,9,Fsaid Streeting was "with respect,
OL,10,Fcompletely wrong"
OL,12,FHe said there had been a "very real"
OL,13,Frise in "distress and mental ill health
OL,14,Famong young people", noting how
OL,15,Fconditions such as anxiety and
OL,16,Fdepression can "worsen the traits of
OL,17,FADHD and autism"
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
