OL,3,AICE agent shoots man in New York City
OL,4,
OL,5,FA US Immigration and Customs
OL,6,FEnforcement (ICE) agent shot a man in
OL,7,Fthe Bronx in New York City on Thursday.
OL,9,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,10,F(DHS), which runs the agency, confirmed
OL,11,Fan ICE officer "discharged his weapon"
OL,12,Fduring "a targeted enforcement
OL,13,Foperation... to arrest a criminal
OL,14,Fillegal alien".
OL,16,FIn a statement, it added the man was
OL,17,Falive and at a local hospital.
OL,19,FNew York mayor Zohran Mamdani said it
OL,20,Fwas an "unconscionable and incredibly
OL,21,Fserious situation".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
